<title>FINLAND: Finnlines sees 1997 profit on par with 96.</title>
<headline>Finnlines sees 1997 profit on par with 96.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish cargo shipping company Finnlines Oy said on Friday its 1997 operating earnings would be on par with the 1996 level.</p>
<p>&quot;1997 operating earnings will probably remain at the previous year's level if the operating environment remains stable,&quot; Finnlines said in a statement with its 1996 results.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
